January 2023, AlphaThera introduced its oYo-Link® HRP reagent, enabling site-specific conjugation of HRP to primary antibodies in under two hours with just 30 seconds hands-on time. The product delivers more uniform, optimized antibody-HRP conjugates for ELISA, western blotting, and IHC.
